Plugin-Version: 1.0.0
Plugin-Class: org.gameyfin.plugins.store.itch.ItchPlugin
Plugin-Id: org.gameyfin.plugins.store.itch
Plugin-Name: itch.io
Plugin-Description: Search itch.io and track the downloads of its games.<br>
 itch.io has no public API for this, so the plugin reads public pages and can break when the site changes.
 Versions are the uploads of a game (with the version name if the developer provides one) and have no dates,
 so Gameyfin cannot tell which one is newest. itch.io has no DLC or editions.
Plugin-Short-Description: Search and downloads from itch.io
Plugin-Author: grimsi
Plugin-License: MIT
Plugin-Url: https://github.com/gameyfin
